t that just lowers the sample rate of the bus.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Why?\r\n\r\nMany games use this effect, either to emulate a \"retro\" feeling or to have some \"disturbing/horror\" vibe.\r\n\r\n### Potential enhancements\r\n\r\nThe max sample rate in the editor is set to 44100Hz, but the user's audioserver sample rate might be different (e.g: 48000Hz). Is there a proper way to change this?\r\n\r\n### Showcase\r\n\r\nmusic is \"Yoni Mayraz - Dybbuk Tse!\"\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae9b2e44-b020-45a5-87b8-eebdb4620aa0\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a47daee0-2103-4bfd-b51b-8bcbb6d5870e\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nP.S:  I used the \"amplifier\" effect code as a template for making this one, if things aren't necessary and can be removed, I might have missed some of them.\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5810*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-08-07T13:24:14Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T14:57:58Z","closed_at":"2025-08-07T14:55:08Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a70d07b5bd2e07ba766460709a1c0d7f0ea87e34","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ObaniGemini:bitcrusher_effect","ref":"bitcrusher_effect",